        (legalized, chance, open) and endless; "mostly by A5" replaced by the
        counts per shell followed and per ruling (match.txt); the chance
        snippets: 38 by the codes of their text, not run again, 5 by
        repeated runs (README said only the races were run again); the 8 of
        rule E said plainly; the 88 of A12 not reviewed yet (README said
        each of the 126 had been looked at); error messages: a run that
        differs only in them counts as agreement (README said they were not
        compared, against its own table).  A new part, "Other ways of
        starting a child, and Windows": through Run on Linux (2026-11-18),
